   "sentenceId": 7,
   "he": "נֶזֶק וַחֲצִי נֶזֶק וְכוּ׳. נֶזֶק הַיְינוּ חֲבָלוֹת? מִשּׁוּם דְּקָא בָּעֵי לְמִיתְנֵא חֲצִי נֶזֶק, תָּנֵי נָמֵי נֶזֶק שָׁלֵם.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches that cases involving payment for «damage and» payment for «half the damage» are adjudicated by three judges. The Gemara challenges: «Damage is» the same as «injury,» since the term: Injury, includes various damages one causes another directly or by his property. The Gemara explains: «Since he needed to teach» the halakha with regard to payment of «half» the cost of «the damage, he also taught» the halakha with regard to payment of the «full» cost of the «damage.»"
  }
